<tr class="spaceNote" id="${idOrganizationHint}" style="display: none">
  <td colspan="2">
    <div class="attentionComment">
      An <strong>organization connection</strong> is associated with a Space organization.
      It can be used as a common root connection to create subsequent <em>project connections</em>.<br/>
      The creation of a dedicated Space application with the appropriate rights will be automatically requested for this purpose.
    </div>
  </td>
</tr>